global gAntalPynt, gPyntSprite, gFarg, gAllaFargadeCount

on mouseDown
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 9 ............................ <the clickOn>
  [  4] setlocal 0 .............................. n = the clickOn
  [  6] getlocal 0 .............................. <n>
  [  8] getglobal 1 ............................. <gPyntSprite>
  [ 10] gteq .................................... <n >= gPyntSprite>
  [ 11] getlocal 0 .............................. <n>
